abstract: >-
  Public research record holding the camera-ready conference abstract (TIMA/FIMA Scientific
  Convention 2026) that proposes Trustworthy Premarital Health Education (T-PHE) as primary
  prevention infrastructure, together with an evidence ledger grading every statement in the
  abstract. Practitioner-led, document-informed conceptual synthesis; no effectiveness testing
  undertaken.
